OL,3,GNEWSAStudy aims to cut veterans'
OL,4,Adementia risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new study could help reduce the risk
OL,7,Fof veterans developing dementia.
OL,9,FThe SERVED project, run by Bournemouth
OL,10,FUniversity's Ageing and Dementia
OL,11,FResearch Centre, is working with
OL,12,Fveterans to raise awareness of brain
OL,13,Fhealth risks and improve support.
OL,15,FAssociate Professor Michele Board, who
OL,16,Fis leading the research, said veterans
OL,17,Fcould be at greater risk due to their
OL,18,Fexposure to dangerous environments and
OL,19,Ftraumatic events.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
