OL,3,GNEWSAStudy aims to cut veterans'
OL,4,Adementia risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrevious research suggests about 45% of
OL,7,Fdementia cases worldwide could
OL,8,Fpotentially be prevented or delayed
OL,9,Fthrough lifestyle changes.
